2643880/extras/c75a1846e7e7afebc5c0e129dfaffdbe.poster.avif?t=1754055379\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643880/extras/c75a1846e7e7afebc5c0e129dfaffdbe.webm?t=1754055379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643880/extras/c75a1846e7e7afebc5c0e129dfaffdbe.mp4?t=1754055379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander vast park areas, explore sports fields, and fun activities like fishing await you in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udecb\ufe0f <strong>Hundreds of items, endless decoration!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Completely design your home freely classic or modern\u2026 the choice is entirely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcf8 <strong>Stand out with the selling and renting system!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br>Get your house ready, take the best photos, sell it or rent it out. Earn big profits from sales or turn rental income into a steady source of earnings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Why should you play right now?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy, renovate and sell or rent for profit</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed decoration with hundreds of items and furniture</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><